  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "Five Tabatas back to back with a minute of rest between them: row (calories), squats, pull-ups, push-ups and sit-ups. Each Tabata is 8 rounds of 20 seconds of work and 10 seconds of rest, and your score for each is the lowest rep count in any of its rounds; add the five together. Twenty-four minutes that reward even pacing over heroics.",
